      "raw_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/raw/d45e42d901b14167d1a2ee3c88bb5c6625eb7d81/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2026-06-23-09-10-00.gh-issue-151722.Kq7mB3.rst",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/contents/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2026-06-23-09-10-00.gh-issue-151722.Kq7mB3.rst?ref=d45e42d901b14167d1a2ee3c88bb5c6625eb7d81",
      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Defer GC tracking of a :class:`frozendict` created by ``frozendict.fromkeys()``\n+until the end of construction, so a half-built instance is no longer observable\n+from another thread in the free threading build."
    },
